{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S02等段落的感受词仍然偏密，容易让观众顾不上听音乐；S13把想听到保证写成仿佛对方已经说过以后不变，也有轻微的情节增写。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事主线拆成更容易捕捉的心理动作，关键字加亮后，观众即使不逐字阅读，也能抓住人物从小心试探、害怕失去到愿意坦然表达的变化。感受文字与音乐节点对应，水面、摇荡、漂浮、靠岸等意象反复呼应，使前后更像同一段经历，同时提供了比X更具体的听觉、身体和情绪细节。Y偶尔有过度解释的问题，但整体上更容易让普通观众边听边理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "12f9c86a-1266-44c7-bc87-1edaf959f928", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001557050396Z", "elapsed_seconds": 94.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:17:31.652496+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "96050971919b6abe0404d2432c6915b728d1558de54e343c80ca61da7804772f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach